---
/**
 * Consulting page: “Frequently Asked Questions” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-47dbeb7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child"
  data-id="47dbeb7"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-8951d33 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
      data-id="8951d33"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="heading.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-bef772c vb-widget vb-widget-n-accordion"
      data-id="bef772c"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-settings={'{"default_state":"expanded","max_items_expended":"one","n_accordion_animation_duration":{"unit":"ms","size":400,"sizes":[]}}'}
      data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <div
          class="e-n-accordion"
          aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys"
        >
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2000" class="e-n-accordion-item" open="">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="1"
              tabindex="0"
              aria-expanded="true"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2000"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  How can a business consultant help grow my business?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2000"
              class="vb-element vb-element-c0d6ede e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="c0d6ede"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-7470105 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="7470105"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    A business consultant identifies growth opportunities, improves processes, and develops strategies
                    to increase revenue and performance.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2001" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="2"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2001"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">What does a management consulting company do?</div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2001"
              class="vb-element vb-element-439de93 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="439de93"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-19f4453 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="19f4453"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    A management consulting company helps businesses solve strategic and operational challenges, improve
                    processes, and drive sustainable growth.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2002" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="3"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2002"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  When should a company hire a management consultant?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2002"
              class="vb-element vb-element-dfab642 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="dfab642"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-325f18f vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="325f18f"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Businesses can benefit from management consulting when facing stagnant growth, inefficiencies,
                    declining profitability, or strategic challenges.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2003" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="4"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2003"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  Can management consulting help small and medium-sized businesses (SMBs)?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2003"
              class="vb-element vb-element-fb74b9d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="fb74b9d"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-a8a3c74 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="a8a3c74"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Yes. SMB consulting helps businesses improve efficiency, profitability, processes, and scalability.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2004" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="5"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2004"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  How do business consultants create growth strategies?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2004"
              class="vb-element vb-element-453f492 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="453f492"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-6b339cf vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="6b339cf"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Business consultants analyse business goals, market opportunities, customer needs, and internal
                    capabilities to create effective growth strategies.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2005" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="6"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2005"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  Can management consulting improve business profitability?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2005"
              class="vb-element vb-element-7087491 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="7087491"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-766c81c vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="766c81c"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Yes. Management consulting can improve profitability by reducing inefficiencies, optimising
                    processes, and identifying revenue opportunities.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2006" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="7"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2006"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  What is the difference between business consulting and business coaching?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2006"
              class="vb-element vb-element-935c8b4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="935c8b4"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-459db36 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="459db36"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Business consulting focuses on solving business challenges and providing strategic solutions, while
                    business coaching focuses on developing leaders and business owners.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2007" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="8"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2007"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">How much does business consulting cost?</div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2007"
              class="vb-element vb-element-0a7a452 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="0a7a452"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-7614f8a vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="7614f8a"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    The cost of business consulting services varies based on the project’s scope, complexity, duration,
                    and specific business requirements.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2008" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="9"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2008"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  How do you approach a business consulting project?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2008"
              class="vb-element vb-element-deb40ed e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="deb40ed"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-7519c91 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="7519c91"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    We begin by understanding the business, diagnosing key challenges, developing solutions, supporting
                    implementation, and tracking outcomes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details id="e-n-accordion-item-2009" class="e-n-accordion-item">
            <summary
              class="e-n-accordion-item-title"
              data-accordion-index="10"
              tabindex="-1"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2009"
            >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-header"
                ><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text">
                  What are the key signs that a business needs consulting support?
                </div></span
              >
              <span class="e-n-accordion-item-title-icon">
                <span class="e-opened"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
                <span class="e-closed"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div
              role="region"
              aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2009"
              class="vb-element vb-element-8373577 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
              data-id="8373577"
              data-element_type="container"
              data-e-type="container"
            >
              <div
                class="vb-element vb-element-12bc7bc vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
                data-id="12bc7bc"
                data-element_type="widget"
                data-e-type="widget"
                data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
              >
                <div class="vb-widget-container">
                  <p class="p1">
                    Stagnant growth, declining profitability, inefficient processes, unclear strategy, and scaling
                    challenges may indicate a need for business consulting support.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
